  data: {
    LLM: "Keep track of which numbers your neighbors are missing. Selling a 'bad' tile to a player who can't use it elsewhere is a key defensive move.\n\nStrategic Buying: Sometimes it's worth buying a tile even if you could pass (if house rules allow), to get closer to a double that allows a secondary play.\n\nManaging your 'chips' is as important as the tiles. If you run out of chips, you may be unable to buy the tile you need to win the round.",
    Player: "Keep track of which numbers your neighbors are missing. Selling a 'bad' tile to a player who can't use it elsewhere is a key defensive move.\n\nStrategic Buying: Sometimes it's worth buying a tile even if you could pass (if house rules allow), to get closer to a double that allows a secondary play.\n\nManaging your 'chips' is as important as the tiles. If you run out of chips, you may be unable to buy the tile you need to win the round.",
